1
00:00:18,679 --> 00:00:20,839
I told you to watch Jiichiro Matsui's residence.

2
00:00:22,239 --> 00:00:23,199
Any sign of Xiaoyu?

3
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:26,199
Jiichiro Matsui's place is heavily guarded.

4
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,519
There's no way to sneak in.

5
00:00:28,719 --> 00:00:29,719
Only Japanese come and go.

6
00:00:30,440 --> 00:00:31,440
Not a trace of Xiaoyu.

7
00:00:31,960 --> 00:00:32,560
But don't worry.

8
00:00:33,159 --> 00:00:34,200
I've had men watching it the whole time.

9
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:38,960
This Jiichiro Matsui...

10
00:00:40,079 --> 00:00:41,200
what's his story, exactly?

11
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:45,280
Five years ago, Jiichiro Matsui came to Rongcheng.

12
00:00:46,079 --> 00:00:47,320
With his sharp business sense,

13
00:00:47,560 --> 00:00:48,399
he quickly made a name for himself.

14
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,880
He rose to president of the Matsui Chamber of Commerce.

15
00:00:51,719 --> 00:00:52,719
In the way he speaks and acts,

16
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:53,560
how he dresses and lives,

17
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:54,920
he's more local than anyone in Rongcheng.

18
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,000
Working both the underworld and high society,

19
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:56,840
he made connections everywhere.

20
00:00:57,719 --> 00:00:59,240
But then he crossed paths with someone

21
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:01,280
who dealt him a massive blow.

22
00:01:04,159 --> 00:01:05,000
My father.

23
00:01:07,920 --> 00:01:09,959
When Matsui proposed bringing Japanese goods to Rongcheng,

24
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:12,560
President Lian rallied all chamber members

25
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:13,760
to boycott Jiichiro Matsui,

26
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,040
calling him a traitor to our nation.

27
00:01:15,959 --> 00:01:17,239
Matsui's business took a heavy hit.

28
00:01:17,519 --> 00:01:18,079
Until...

29
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:19,400
Until something happened to my father.

30
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,280
With no obstacles left,

31
00:01:22,239 --> 00:01:24,239
his business infiltrated every sector,

32
00:01:25,120 --> 00:01:26,879
expanding across Rongcheng unimpeded.

33
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:29,239
Matsui is fiercely vindictive.

34
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:30,840
Aside from your father,

35
00:01:31,359 --> 00:01:33,000
the other members who boycotted him

36
00:01:33,120 --> 00:01:34,000
had their families destroyed

37
00:01:34,120 --> 00:01:34,959
or were driven to total ruin.

38
00:01:35,719 --> 00:01:36,959
Recently, the one who spoke out against him,

39
00:01:36,959 --> 00:01:38,400
the patriotic overseas Chinese, Mr. He Xianwei,

40
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:39,760
was assassinated as well.

41
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:43,920
Go on.

42
00:01:44,519 --> 00:01:47,200
Of the He family, only his wife Feng Xiaozhu

43
00:01:47,400 --> 00:01:49,040
and daughter He Susu have only each other.

44
00:01:54,239 --> 00:01:54,680
Oh no!

45
00:02:08,479 --> 00:02:09,840
His pulse is weak,

46
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:11,400
and his temperature is abnormal.

47
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:20,680
Boss Chen,

48
00:02:20,879 --> 00:02:21,759
the wound is inflamed,

49
00:02:22,039 --> 00:02:22,879
and the high fever won't break.

50
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:24,199
If we want to save him,

51
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,479
we must use antibiotics.

52
00:02:26,159 --> 00:02:27,319
Otherwise, if this drags on,

53
00:02:27,520 --> 00:02:28,639
his life will be in danger.

54
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,599
Thank you for treating him, Dr. Liu.

55
00:02:31,199 --> 00:02:31,960
Please keep this confidential.

56
00:02:32,199 --> 00:02:33,000
Don't breathe a word to anyone.

57
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,680
Right now, only foreign churches,

58
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:45,960
Tating Hospital, or the black market

59
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:47,039
might have antibiotics.

60
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:48,800
But antibiotics are already scarce,

61
00:02:49,039 --> 00:02:50,400
and strictly controlled.

62
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:51,599
How are we supposed to find any?

63
00:02:53,960 --> 00:02:55,039
No matter what,

64
00:02:55,759 --> 00:02:57,080
we have to take the risk.

65
00:03:03,919 --> 00:03:05,360
We were entrusted by Mr. He before his death

66
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,719
to protect you and your daughter.

67
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:09,719
My husband never mentioned this to me.

68
00:03:10,120 --> 00:03:10,680
Go away!

69
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:11,960
Please come with us.

70
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:13,639
What are you doing?

71
00:03:14,039 --> 00:03:14,800
Let go of my daughter!

72
00:03:19,400 --> 00:03:20,000
Mom!

73
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:29,719
Susu!

74
00:03:30,120 --> 00:03:30,680
Mom!

75
00:03:30,919 --> 00:03:31,479
Susu!

76
00:03:33,560 --> 00:03:34,039
Susu!

77
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:34,919
Are you all right?

78
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:39,039
Looks like your arm is injured.

79
00:03:40,039 --> 00:03:41,800
I'm Lian Ye, Hall Master of the Sanshan Gang.

80
00:03:42,439 --> 00:03:43,360
Those two men just now...

81
00:03:43,360 --> 00:03:45,879
They might come back to cause you trouble.

82
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:47,719
If you trust me,

83
00:03:48,719 --> 00:03:49,479
let us

84
00:03:49,680 --> 00:03:51,319
escort you to Tating Hospital for treatment.

85
00:03:56,919 --> 00:03:58,599
If anything comes up, just let us know,

86
00:03:58,800 --> 00:03:59,680
and we'll handle it immediately.

87
00:04:00,120 --> 00:04:02,479
Why trouble yourself to come in person, Commander?

88
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,599
You're too kind, Director.

89
00:04:12,199 --> 00:04:14,840
This time, I came specifically to see Mingyuan.

90
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:17,160
I have an important task for him.

91
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:18,360
Senior.

92
00:04:18,639 --> 00:04:19,240
Please, go ahead.

93
00:04:19,879 --> 00:04:20,759
What happened in Southern Anhui,

94
00:04:20,879 --> 00:04:22,199
I assume you've all heard about it.

95
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:23,439
The Generalissimo has given orders:

96
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:24,720
purge the Communists,

97
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:26,079
with zero tolerance for failure.

98
00:04:27,279 --> 00:04:29,120
The Japanese military is getting restless,

99
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:32,319
and our garrison is stretched thin.

100
00:04:32,879 --> 00:04:34,519
So regarding the Communists,

101
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:38,040
the police must pay closer attention.

102
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:41,600
To maintain peace and stability in Rongcheng,

103
00:04:41,879 --> 00:04:43,040
this is of vital importance.

104
00:04:44,120 --> 00:04:44,959
Rest assured, Senior.

105
00:04:45,279 --> 00:04:46,319
What the Principal entrusted to us,

106
00:04:46,560 --> 00:04:47,519
as his student, it's my duty to fulfill.

107
00:04:49,360 --> 00:04:49,959
Good.

108
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,319
Get back to work.

109
00:04:52,879 --> 00:04:53,720
No need to see me out.

110
00:04:54,240 --> 00:04:54,879
Take care, sir.

111
00:04:58,639 --> 00:04:59,279
Mingyuan.

112
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:01,600
I'll leave the rest to you.

113
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:02,800
Yes, Director.

114
00:05:09,519 --> 00:05:11,439
Director Li, an incident occurred on New Year's Eve.

115
00:05:11,839 --> 00:05:13,720
The deceased is the patriotic overseas Chinese, He Xianwei.

116
00:05:14,319 --> 00:05:15,519
He had close ties with the Communists.

117
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:17,120
Another person in the car fled.

118
00:05:17,680 --> 00:05:18,639
Blood on the road indicates

119
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:20,040
that he was severely wounded.

120
00:05:22,519 --> 00:05:23,879
Send men to closely monitor churches,

121
00:05:23,879 --> 00:05:24,800
the black market, and hospitals.

122
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:27,519
Keep an eye on patients and staff, and track the flow of antibiotics.

123
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:28,680
Yes, sir.

124
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:33,800
Wait.

125
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:34,639
Who is he?

126
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:35,560
What are you doing?

127
00:05:35,759 --> 00:05:36,319
This is an emergency!

128
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:37,160
Someone could die!

129
00:05:44,759 --> 00:05:45,319
What are you doing here?

130
00:05:46,279 --> 00:05:48,120
Dr. Xu sent me to get anesthetics.

131
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:28,360
By order of Deputy Director Li,

132
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:29,800
check your stock of antibiotics.

133
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:38,360
Don't worry.

134
00:06:38,600 --> 00:06:40,360
Our medications are strictly controlled.

135
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:48,560
Two vials of antibiotics are missing.

136
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:49,800
Who came in just now?

137
00:06:50,279 --> 00:06:51,040
A nurse.

138
00:06:51,560 --> 00:06:52,240
She was just here.

139
00:06:52,399 --> 00:06:53,120
Where did she go?

140
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:54,160
What's going on?

141
00:06:54,839 --> 00:06:56,399
A fake nurse stole antibiotics.

142
00:06:57,160 --> 00:06:57,839
Lock down the hospital!

143
00:06:58,399 --> 00:06:59,319
No one goes in or out!

144
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:08,879
Nurses!

145
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:09,959
Show your IDs.

146
00:07:58,759 --> 00:07:59,360
Boss Chen.

147
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:00,360
What brings you to the hospital?

148
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,319
Caught in the harsh wind a few days ago,

149
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:04,040
I came down with a cold,

150
00:08:04,519 --> 00:08:05,480
so I came to pick up some medicine.

151
00:08:06,279 --> 00:08:07,399
Be sure to keep yourself warm, then.

152
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:08,920
Get well soon.

153
00:08:10,759 --> 00:08:11,639
While questioning the local residents,

154
00:08:11,959 --> 00:08:13,199
someone claimed to have seen a Communist

155
00:08:13,199 --> 00:08:14,240
flee toward Huamoli,

156
00:08:14,439 --> 00:08:15,240
and then vanish completely.

157
00:08:23,319 --> 00:08:23,879
What is it?

158
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:24,879
Chief Li,

159
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,079
two vials of antibiotics were stolen.

160
00:08:26,319 --> 00:08:27,360
We're screening the suspects right now.

161
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:31,319
Let me see.

162
00:08:37,039 --> 00:08:37,879
Let me see.

163
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:39,360
Mingyuan.

164
00:08:53,600 --> 00:08:55,919
Isn't it just some cosmetics for girls?

165
00:08:57,799 --> 00:08:59,279
Why can't Brother Mingyuan see it?

166
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,240
Brother Mingyuan!

167
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:12,480
I told you.

168
00:09:12,600 --> 00:09:15,639
You cops are always paranoid.

169
00:09:16,240 --> 00:09:18,000
Can't you catch someone who actually matters?

170
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:19,120
Brother Mingyuan, right?

171
00:09:19,720 --> 00:09:20,600
Routine inspection clear.

172
00:09:20,879 --> 00:09:21,519
You're free to go.

173
00:09:26,519 --> 00:09:27,279
Let's go, Brother Mingyuan.

174
00:09:56,720 --> 00:09:57,600
Bastard!

175
00:10:00,720 --> 00:10:03,000
Throw him in a cell and starve him for three days

176
00:10:03,399 --> 00:10:05,759
until he learns how to eat sushi properly.

177
00:10:06,279 --> 00:10:06,720
Yes, sir.

178
00:10:15,919 --> 00:10:16,559
Mr. Matsui.

179
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:19,360
The major general had this delivered.

180
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:24,639
"Matsui,

181
00:10:25,279 --> 00:10:27,200
you have failed repeatedly in Rongcheng.

182
00:10:27,600 --> 00:10:29,200
I am deeply disappointed in you.

183
00:10:29,960 --> 00:10:31,159
I am giving you one last chance.

184
00:10:31,679 --> 00:10:33,039
You must have 100 soldiers

185
00:10:33,279 --> 00:10:35,279
infiltrate Rongcheng before the 31st

186
00:10:35,759 --> 00:10:36,480
to support the Rongcheng operation,

187
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:37,799
the night raid of Operation Plan C4.

188
00:10:38,279 --> 00:10:39,639
If anything goes wrong, atone with seppuku."

189
00:10:54,480 --> 00:10:55,200
You know each other?

190
00:10:56,799 --> 00:10:57,679
Ms. Feng, don't you remember?

191
00:10:58,360 --> 00:10:59,120
Three years ago,

192
00:10:59,759 --> 00:11:01,039
at Wenshan Girls' School,

193
00:11:01,320 --> 00:11:02,519
I applied to teach Chinese literature.

194
00:11:04,919 --> 00:11:06,080
No wonder you looked so familiar.

195
00:11:06,519 --> 00:11:07,399
It's you!

196
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:09,120
Ms. Feng,

197
00:11:09,559 --> 00:11:11,320
Japanese agents are targeting you and Susu.

198
00:11:11,759 --> 00:11:13,519
Why don't you stay with the Sanshan Gang for a few days?

199
00:11:14,519 --> 00:11:15,759
Mr. He was a patriotic overseas Chinese

200
00:11:16,360 --> 00:11:17,639
who did so much for our people.

201
00:11:18,159 --> 00:11:18,960
The Sanshan Gang

202
00:11:19,399 --> 00:11:21,000
will never let the Japanese bully you.

203
00:11:26,519 --> 00:11:27,080
Thank you.

204
00:11:27,759 --> 00:11:28,320
Dali,

205
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:29,919
escort them back first.

206
00:11:30,879 --> 00:11:31,279
Alright.

207
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,279
Can you give it back to me now?

208
00:11:47,879 --> 00:11:49,440
What can't you let Brother Mingyuan see?

209
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:50,600
Brother Mingyuan...

210
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,679
You have to tell me first:

211
00:11:54,919 --> 00:11:56,320
why take such a huge risk

212
00:11:57,120 --> 00:11:57,840
to steal antibiotics?

213
00:12:00,679 --> 00:12:01,799
Lives are at stake.

214
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,120
I can't tell you.

215
00:12:08,799 --> 00:12:09,919
You can't even tell me?

216
00:12:25,200 --> 00:12:26,519
You'll find out sooner or later.
